      "line": 68,
      "start": 456,
      "end": 516,
      "source_quote": "名{{ProperNoun|蓋}}，即{{ProperNoun|-{甯}-}}妹也，生{{ProperNoun|忱}}。",
      "note": "劉注所引王氏譜明母與舅。",
      "source_sha256": "fe12e14d6e67a7ed4e8b0ca80124762d30c1995b3f890783ada310c1f80cb40e"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo031-ws1517699.wikitext",
      "revision": 1517699,
      "line": 15,
      "start": 110,
      "end": 123,
      "source_quote": "少時，石民死，王忱為荊州。",
      "note": "注引靈鬼志謠徵明作石民。",
      "source_sha256": "fa4ada6bda679a5a317c7c4863510584757f4d25e852bd26e810fab66b0b8338"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo031-ws1517699.wikitext",
