      "revision": 2274839,
      "line": 60,
      "start": 1,
      "end": 23,
      "source_quote": "王佛大嘆言：「三日不飲酒，覺形神不復相親。」",
      "note": "世說正文作王佛大。",
      "source_sha256": "9fbdb1a23ed6e1f1510ebe52d2987873ad1ff65d027a4a55d8f64ffadeb8fdd0"
    },
    {
